1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,682
Hi, little friends, I'm Kiki.

2
00:00:03,632 --> 00:00:09,558
Today the storybook opened to a page full of stars Wow, so many stars!

3
00:00:09,558 --> 00:00:12,941
Kiki met a little boy from the stars.

4
00:00:12,941 --> 00:00:16,176
His name is... the Little Prince!

5
00:00:16,176 --> 00:00:20,661
The Little Prince lived on a very, very tiny planet.

6
00:00:20,661 --> 00:00:22,941
There was only him.

7
00:00:22,941 --> 00:00:25,308
And... a rose.

8
00:00:25,308 --> 00:00:28,176
This rose was so beautiful.

9
00:00:28,176 --> 00:00:31,249
Red petals, so soft.

10
00:00:31,249 --> 00:00:34,544
The Little Prince watered her every day.

11
00:00:34,544 --> 00:00:37,161
You should drink more water.

12
00:00:37,161 --> 00:00:40,426
He even made a glass cover for her.

13
00:00:40,426 --> 00:00:43,249
So the wind won't blow on you.

14
00:00:43,249 --> 00:00:46,117
But the rose was a bit spoiled.

15
00:00:46,117 --> 00:00:49,749
I'm so cold, please open the cover.

16
00:00:49,749 --> 00:00:53,367
No, the wind is too strong outside!

17
00:00:53,367 --> 00:00:56,632
Hmph, you don't care about me at all!

18
00:00:56,632 --> 00:00:59,617
The Little Prince was so sad.

19
00:00:59,617 --> 00:01:02,102
He didn't know what to do.

20
00:01:02,102 --> 00:01:06,867
The Little Prince decided to leave the planet and go see the world.

21
00:01:06,867 --> 00:01:10,852
When the rose saw him leaving, her petals drooped.

22
00:01:10,852 --> 00:01:12,705
Just go...

23
00:01:12,705 --> 00:01:14,779
I don't need you.

24
00:01:14,779 --> 00:01:19,279
But Kiki saw... the rose secretly shed a teardrop.

25
00:01:19,279 --> 00:01:23,367
And the Little Prince kept looking back a few times.

26
00:01:23,367 --> 00:01:27,176
Kiki ran over and gently touched the rose.

27
00:01:27,176 --> 00:01:29,470
Do you miss him already?

28
00:01:29,470 --> 00:01:31,852
The rose shook her head.

29
00:01:31,852 --> 00:01:33,779
Not at all...

30
00:01:33,779 --> 00:01:36,588
But her petals were trembling.

31
00:01:36,588 --> 00:01:38,955
Kiki thought about it.

32
00:01:38,955 --> 00:01:42,249
My mom sometimes gets angry too.

33
00:01:42,249 --> 00:01:45,264
But she doesn't really dislike me.

34
00:01:45,264 --> 00:01:49,014
She just wants me to say 'I love you' more often.

35
00:01:49,014 --> 00:01:53,191
Kiki called out to the Little Prince — "Little Prince!

36
00:01:53,191 --> 00:01:56,485
You haven't said goodbye to the rose yet!

37
00:01:56,485 --> 00:01:58,970
The Little Prince stopped.

38
00:01:58,970 --> 00:02:05,647
He turned around, and gently said to the rose — "I'm sorry, I should have listened to you more.

39
00:02:05,647 --> 00:02:09,397
The rose's petals finally stopped trembling.

40
00:02:09,397 --> 00:02:12,691
You... be careful on your journey.

41
00:02:12,691 --> 00:02:15,117
The Little Prince nodded.

42
00:02:15,117 --> 00:02:17,294
I will come back.

43
00:02:17,294 --> 00:02:20,058
I promise I will come back.

44
00:02:20,058 --> 00:02:23,470
Kiki watched the Little Prince walk away.

45
00:02:23,470 --> 00:02:29,514
She thought — the people you love the most are sometimes the hardest to speak your heart to.

46
00:02:29,514 --> 00:02:33,220
Little friends, who do you cherish the most?

47
00:02:33,220 --> 00:02:35,735
Go tell them "I love you

